With respect to academic disciplines in tertiary education, “Business & administration” was the most
popular discipline, accounting for 30.5% of the total, which was followed by “Humanities & languages” (9.0%)
and “Tourism, hotel & catering services” (8.4%).
Chart 15: Most Popular Tertiary Education Programmes of Local Population
As regards the place where the degree/diploma of tertiary education was obtained, 44.2% of
the academic degrees/diplomas were obtained in Macao, whereas those awarded in mainland China,
Taiwan region and Hong Kong Special Administrative Region made up 29.5%, 10.5% and 2.8%
respectively. Academic degrees/diplomas obtained overseas constituted 13.0% of the total, and most of
them (7.8%) were conferred in the United Kingdom, Australia and the United States.
